set {playing} = true
test: In a 4D spatial coordinate system, how many mutually perpendicular axes meet at the origin?
- 4 axes
	set {correct} += 1.0
	test: correct
- 3 axes
	test: wrong
- 8 axes
	test: wrong
- 10 axes
	test: wrong

test: How many vertices (corner points) are present in a 4D hypercube (tesseract)?
- 12
	test: wrong
- 16
	set {correct} += 1.0
	test: correct
- 28
	test: wrong
- 4
	test: wrong

test: If you 'unfold' a 3D cube, you get a net of 2D squares. What is produced when you 'unfold' a 4D tesseract into 3D space?
- A net of 6 squares
	test: wrong
- A net of 8 cubes
	set {correct} += 1.0
	test: correct
- A single 3D sphere
	test: wrong
- A net of 16 tetrahedrons
	test: wrong

